#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the capability of saving sets of simulation results based on a single Run Control dataset.
#
#The selection to save sets of simulation results is made using the drop-down menu below the Animator: Camera dataset on the right side of the Run Control screen. For this example, the selection is "Keep 5".
#
#The Sprung Mass value is overwritten in the Run Control screen's Miscellaneous Yellow Field for each of the four additional runs using the keyword M_SU. The results from each of these tests are overlaid.
